{"ticker":"BRK-B","updated":"2026-10-23T22:42:30Z","profile":{"longName":"Berkshire Hathaway Inc.","shortName":"Berkshire Hathaway Inc. New","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Diversified","country":"United States","website":"https://www.berkshirehathaway.com","fullTimeEmployees":387800,"marketCap":1160671395840,"trailingPE":13.63657,"forwardPE":24.170942,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.0171838,"pegRatio":10.06,"targetMeanPrice":555.6667,"targetHighPrice":628.0,"targetLowPrice":510.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":3,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.1,"earningsGrowth":1.078,"grossMargins":0.30332002,"operatingMargins":0.32561,"profitMargins":0.22296,"totalRevenue":384687013888,"beta":0.595,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":549.96,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":464.01,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Berkshire Hathaway Inc., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the insurance, freight rail transportation, and utility businesses. The company provides property, casualty, life, accident, and health insurance and reinsurance; operates railroad systems in North America; generates, transmits, stores, and distributes electricity from natural gas, coal, wind, solar, hydroelectric, nuclear, and geothermal sources; operates natural gas distribution and storage facilities, interstate pipelines, liquefied natural gas facilities, and compressor and meter stations; and holds interest in coal mining assets. It manufactures boxed chocolates and other confectionery products; specialty chemicals, metal cutting tools, and components for aerospace and power generation applications; prefabricated and site-built residential homes, flooring products; insulation, roofing, and engineered products; building and engineered components; paints and coatings; and bricks and masonry products, as well as offers manufactured and site-built home construction, and related lending and financial services. In addition, the company provides recreational vehicles, apparel, footwear, toys, jewelry, custom picture framing products, alkaline batteries, logistics services, and professional aviation training and shared aircraft ownership programs; castings, forgings, fasteners/fastener systems, aerostructures, and","summary_zh":"波克夏海瑟威及其子公司從事保險、鐵路貨運和公用事業業務。該公司提供財產保險、意外傷害保險、人壽保險、意外保險、健康保險和再保險；在北美運營鐵路系統；利用天然氣、煤炭、風能、太陽能、水力發電、核能和地熱源發電、傳輸、儲存和分配電力；經營天然氣分配和儲存設施、州際管道、液化天然氣設施以及壓縮機和計量站；並持有煤礦量權益。它生產盒裝巧克力和其他糖果產品；特殊化學品、金屬切割工具以及航空航天和發電應用部件；預製和現場建造的住宅、地板產品；絕緣、屋頂和工程產品；建築和工程組件；油漆和塗料；磚和磚石產品，並提供製造和現場建造的房屋建築以及相關的貸款和金融服務。此外，該公司還提供休閒車、服裝、鞋類、玩具、珠寶、客製化相框產品、鹼性電池、物流服務以及專業航空培訓和共享飛機所有權計劃；鑄件、鍛件、緊固件/緊固件系統、航空結構以及","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 多元化","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":489.01,"h":489.02,"l":481.83,"c":486.18,"v":3935100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":485.02,"h":492.79,"l":484.53,"c":492.21,"v":8217500},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":491.08,"h":497.21,"l":490.6,"c":495.72,"v":4385900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":498.03,"h":500.14,"l":496.07,"c":499.86,"v":4530400},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":500.85,"h":506.72,"l":500.85,"c":502.98,"v":4663600},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":504.24,"h":505.9,"l":497.62,"c":501.14,"v":4977800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":499.55,"h":502.11,"l":496.59,"c":501.49,"v":3206200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":502.9,"h":507.38,"l":501.26,"c":506.91,"v":2976700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":506.0,"h":507.66,"l":497.75,"c":499.77,"v":4222900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":499.0,"h":499.65,"l":493.46,"c":493.78,"v":5146300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":492.45,"h":496.85,"l":491.72,"c":492.72,"v":3748700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":490.0,"h":491.7,"l":486.27,"c":490.08,"v":5561600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":489.33,"h":497.24,"l":489.03,"c":496.91,"v":3669000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":495.75,"h":497.63,"l":493.34,"c":493.74,"v":2951700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":493.6,"h":495.27,"l":489.5,"c":491.54,"v":3629800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":491.27,"h":491.92,"l":487.2,"c":490.99,"v":4070000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":490.94,"h":495.99,"l":490.3,"c":492.33,"v":5060700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":489.64,"h":494.88,"